---
export async function getStaticPaths() {
	return [{ params: { lang: 'es' } }, { params: { lang: 'en' } }];
}

const { lang } = Astro.params;
const locale = lang === 'es' || lang === 'en' ? lang : 'en';
const isEs = locale === 'es';

const pageTitle = isEs
	? 'Sol contra Luna: la guerra que nadie nombra'
	: 'Sun against Moon: the war no one names';
const pageSummary = isEs
	? 'Hay una grieta que atraviesa la historia del Mediterráneo y Oriente Próximo desde hace milenios. No es la que suelen contar los libros de religión. No se trata de monoteísmo contra politeísmo, ni de bien contra mal. Es algo más antiguo y más preciso: una batalla entre dos formas de entender el tiempo, la autoridad y lo sagrado.'
	: "It's not monotheism versus polytheism. It's a battle between two ways of understanding time, authority, and the sacred.";
const pageDate = new Date('2026-06-16');
const dateStr = pageDate.toLocaleDateString(isEs ? 'es-MX' : 'en-US', {
	year: 'numeric',
	month: 'long',
	day: 'numeric',
});

// ── CONTENT ── Edit texts here ──────────────────────────────
const t = {
	intro1: isEs
		? 'Hay una grieta que atraviesa la historia del Mediterráneo y Oriente Próximo desde hace milenios. No es la que suelen contar los libros de religión. No se trata de monoteísmo contra politeísmo, ni de bien contra mal. Es algo más antiguo y más preciso: una batalla entre dos formas de entender el tiempo, la autoridad y lo sagrado.'
		: "There's a rift running through the history of the Mediterranean and the Near East that goes back millennia. It's not the one religion textbooks usually tell. It's not about monotheism versus polytheism, nor good versus evil. It's something older and more precise: a battle between two ways of understanding time, authority, and the sacred.",
	callIt: isEs ? 'La llamo Sol vs Luna.' : 'I call it Sun vs Moon.',
	intro2: isEs
		? 'No es una metáfora astronómica. Es una estructura. Una que se repite, se disfraza y se infiltra en religiones, imperios y textos sagrados, incluso cuando ya nadie recuerda sus nombres originales.'
		: "This is not an astronomical metaphor. It's a structure. One that repeats, disguises itself, and infiltrates religions, empires, and sacred texts, even when no one remembers its original names anymore.",

	logicasTitle: isEs ? 'Dos lógicas enfrentadas' : 'Two opposing logics',
	solarLogic: isEs
		? 'Un lado busca la verdad única que ilumina y quema.'
		: 'One side seeks the single truth that illuminates and burns.',
	lunarLogic: isEs
		? 'El otro cuida secretos que solo brillan de noche.'
		: 'The other guards secrets that only shine at night.',

	// Table
	tableAspect: isEs ? 'Aspecto' : 'Aspect',
	tableSolar: isEs ? 'Sistema Solar' : 'Solar System',
	tableLunar: isEs ? 'Sistema Lunar' : 'Lunar System',
	tableRows: isEs
		? [
				[
					'Tiempo',
					'Lineal, con origen y fin',
					'Cíclico, rítmico, sin culminación',
				],
				['Verdad', 'Revelada, absoluta', 'Escrita, gradual, técnica'],
				[
					'Figura central',
					'Profeta, mártir, redentor',
					'Escriba, astrólogo, guardián del ritmo',
				],
				[
					'Salvación',
					'Por sacrificio y obediencia',
					'Por equilibrio y corrección',
				],
				[
					'Rito',
					'Sacrificio, testimonio, drama',
					'Recitación exacta, inscripción',
				],
				['Error', 'Desobediencia', 'Desfase, error de cálculo'],
				[
					'Autoridad',
					'Vertical, carismática',
					'Horizontal, por pericia y transmisión',
				],
			]
		: [
				[
					'Time',
					'Linear, with beginning and end',
					'Cyclical, rhythmic, without culmination',
				],
				['Truth', 'Revealed, absolute', 'Written, gradual, technical'],
				[
					'Central figure',
					'Prophet, martyr, redeemer',
					'Scribe, astrologer, guardian of rhythm',
				],
				[
					'Salvation',
					'Through sacrifice and obedience',
					'Through balance and correction',
				],
				[
					'Rite',
					'Sacrifice, testimony, drama',
					'Exact recitation, inscription',
				],
				['Error', 'Disobedience', 'Miscalculation, drift'],
				[
					'Authority',
					'Vertical, charismatic',
					'Horizontal, by expertise and transmission',
				],
			],

	tableNote: isEs
		? 'El primer sistema vence al caos y establece orden. El segundo regula ciclos sin destruirlo. Uno habla de juicio final. El otro, de retorno y ajuste.'
		: 'The first system defeats chaos and establishes order. The second regulates cycles without destroying them. One speaks of final judgment. The other, of return and readjustment.',

	historiaTitle: isEs
		? 'Cómo se manifiesta en la historia'
		: 'How it manifests in history',
	histBabylon: isEs
		? 'En Babilonia, Marduk derrota a Tiamat y funda el orden solar. Sin, el dios lunar de Harrán, representa el otro polo: el decreto que circula, el cálculo, el ritmo.'
		: 'In Babylon, Marduk defeats Tiamat and founds the solar order. Sin, the lunar god of Harran, represents the other pole: the decree that circulates, the calculation, the rhythm.',
	histSunni: isEs
		? 'Siglos después, el islam sunita hereda mucho del polo lunar: calendario lunar, recitación precisa, ausencia de clero formal, énfasis en la cadena de transmisión.'
		: 'Centuries later, Sunni Islam inherits much of the lunar pole: a lunar calendar, precise recitation, absence of formal clergy, emphasis on chains of transmission.',
	histShia: isEs
		? 'El chiismo, en cambio, introduce el sacrificio histórico (Husayn), el clero jerárquico y la espera del Mahdi. Es solar.'
		: 'Shiism, by contrast, introduces historical sacrifice (Husayn), hierarchical clergy, and the expectation of the Mahdi. It is solar.',
	histCatholic: isEs
		? 'El catolicismo es claramente solar: tiempo lineal, sacrificio redentor, tradición viva por encima de la letra. El protestantismo intenta volver al texto puro, pero mantiene el tiempo escatológico sin lograr estabilizarlo litúrgicamente. Es un sistema solar desmantelado.'
		: "Catholicism is clearly solar: linear time, redemptive sacrifice, living tradition above the letter. Protestantism attempts to return to the pure text but maintains eschatological time without managing to stabilize it liturgically. It's a dismantled solar system.",
	histNone: isEs
		? 'Ninguno de los dos bandos desaparece. El lunar se refugia en los márgenes, en los calendarios, en las cadenas de transmisión. El solar domina las narrativas épicas y los grandes imperios.'
		: 'Neither side disappears. The lunar side takes refuge in the margins, in calendars, in chains of transmission. The solar side dominates epic narratives and great empires.',

	zohraTitle: isEs
		? 'Zohra y el momento de la ruptura'
		: 'Zohra and the moment of rupture',
	zohra1: isEs
		? 'Esta distinción no es solo teoría. Es el esqueleto de la novela que estoy escribiendo.'
		: "This distinction is not just theory. It's the skeleton of the novel I'm writing.",
	zohra2: isEs
		? 'Zohra no elige entre los dos mundos. Camina entre ellos. Intenta no traicionar ni al decreto lunar ni a la llamada del sacrificio. Cada paso que da, algo la hala. No hay reconciliación posible porque los dos sistemas no están hechos para convivir: uno alumbra, el otro quema.'
		: "Zohra doesn't choose between the two worlds. She walks between them. She tries not to betray either the lunar decree or the call of sacrifice. Every step she takes, something pulls at her. No reconciliation is possible because the two systems aren't made to coexist: one illuminates, the other burns.",
	zohra3: isEs
		? 'Cuando llegue el final, no habrá revelación emocional. Habrá una tablilla. Una fórmula. Un acto de memoria exacta. Porque lo lunar no se gana. Se merece.'
		: "When the ending comes, there will be no emotional revelation. There will be a tablet. A formula. An act of exact memory. Because the lunar is not won. It's earned.",

	cierreTitle: isEs ? 'La línea y el cálamo' : 'The line and the calamus',
	cierre1: isEs
		? 'La historia del mundo no es entre el bien y el mal.'
		: 'The history of the world is not between good and evil.',
	cierre2: isEs
		? 'Es entre los hijos del Sol y los hijos de la Luna.'
		: "It's between the children of the Sun and the children of the Moon.",
	cierre3: isEs
		? 'Uno busca una verdad que todo lo consuma.'
		: 'One seeks a truth that consumes everything.',
	cierre4: isEs
		? 'El otro preserva lo que solo se ve cuando la luz se atenúa.'
		: 'The other preserves what can only be seen when the light dims.',
	cierre5: isEs
		? 'Ambos necesitan al otro para definirse. Pero ninguno puede convivir con el otro sin que arda el cielo.'
		: 'Both need the other to define themselves. But neither can coexist with the other without the sky catching fire.',
	cierre6: isEs
		? 'Esta es la fractura que mi novela intenta dramatizar. No es un retelling de Babilonia. Es el momento en que una cosmología fue arrinconada, pero no destruida.'
		: "This is the fracture my novel tries to dramatize. It's not a retelling of Babylon. It's the moment when a cosmology was cornered, but not destroyed.",
	cierreMoon: isEs ? 'La luna escribe lento.' : 'The moon writes slowly.',
	cierreForget: isEs ? 'Pero no olvida.' : "But it doesn't forget.",

	backLabel: isEs ? '← Volver al Cuaderno' : '← Back to Notebook',
	sectionLabel: isEs ? 'Cuaderno' : 'Notebook',
};

const siteTitle = 'César Fernando';
const canonicalPath = Astro.url.pathname;
const otherLocale = locale === 'es' ? 'en' : 'es';
const otherPath = canonicalPath.replace(`/${locale}`, `/${otherLocale}`);
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang={locale}>
	<head>
		<meta charset="UTF-8" />
		<meta
			name="viewport"
			content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"
		/>
		<title>{pageTitle} — {siteTitle}</title>
		<meta
			name="description"
			content={pageSummary}
		/>
		<meta
			property="og:title"
			content={pageTitle}
		/>
		<meta
			property="og:description"
			content={pageSummary}
		/>
		<meta
			property="og:type"
			content="article"
		/>
		<meta
			property="og:url"
			content={canonicalPath}
		/>
		<link
			rel="canonical"
			href={canonicalPath}
		/>
		<link
			rel="alternate"
			hreflang={otherLocale}
			href={otherPath}
		/>
		<link
			rel="alternate"
			hreflang={locale}
			href={canonicalPath}
		/>
		<link
			rel="preconnect"
			href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"
		/>
		<link
			rel="preconnect"
			href="https://fonts.gstatic.com"
			crossorigin
		/>
		<link
			href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Marcellus&family=EB+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400&display=swap"
			rel="stylesheet"
		/>
		<link
			rel="icon"
			type="image/svg+xml"
			href="/favicon.svg"
		/>
		<script
			async
			src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-98BKLBE5PZ"
		></script>
		<script>
			window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
			function gtag() {
				dataLayer.push(arguments);
			}
			gtag('js', new Date());
			gtag('config', 'G-98BKLBE5PZ');
		</script>
		<style>
			:root {
				--bg-deep: #060609;
				--bg-dark: #0d0d14;
				--solar-glow: #f59e0b;
				--solar-warm: #d97706;
				--solar-deep: #78350f;
				--solar-bg: #1a1208;
				--lunar-glow: #60a5fa;
				--lunar-cool: #3b82f6;
				--lunar-deep: #1e3a5f;
				--lunar-bg: #0a0f1a;
				--text-primary: #f0ebe0;
				--text-muted: #9ca3af;
			--font-display: 'Marcellus', serif;
			--font-body: 'EB Garamond', Georgia, serif;
			}
			*,
			*::before,
			*::after {
				box-sizing: border-box;
				margin: 0;
				padding: 0;
			}
			html {
				scroll-behavior: smooth;
				background: var(--bg-deep);
			}
			body {
				font-family: var(--font-body);
				font-size: 1.15rem;
				line-height: 1.75;
				color: var(--text-primary);
				background: var(--bg-deep);
				-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
			}

			/* ── Hero ── */
			.hero {
				position: relative;
				min-height: 100vh;
				display: flex;
				flex-direction: column;
				align-items: center;
				justify-content: center;
				text-align: center;
				padding: 2rem;
				overflow: hidden;
			}
			.hero::before {
				content: '';
				position: absolute;
				inset: 0;
				background:
					radial-gradient(
						ellipse 60% 50% at 30% 50%,
						rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.12) 0%,
						transparent 60%
					),
					radial-gradient(
						ellipse 50% 50% at 70% 50%,
						rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.1) 0%,
						transparent 60%
					),
					radial-gradient(
						ellipse 80% 40% at 50% 80%,
						rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.06) 0%,
						transparent 70%
					);
				z-index: 0;
			}
			.hero-content {
				position: relative;
				z-index: 1;
				max-width: 900px;
			}
			.hero h1 {
				font-family: var(--font-display);
				font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
				font-weight: 700;
				line-height: 1.15;
				letter-spacing: 0.02em;
				background: linear-gradient(
					135deg,
					#fbbf24 0%,
					#f59e0b 25%,
					#e5e7eb 50%,
					#60a5fa 75%,
					#93c5fd 100%
				);
				-webkit-background-clip: text;
				-webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
				background-clip: text;
				margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
			}
			.hero .date {
				font-family: var(--font-display);
				font-size: 0.95rem;
				color: var(--text-muted);
				letter-spacing: 0.05em;
				margin-bottom: 1rem;
			}
			.hero .summary {
				font-size: 1.2rem;
				color: var(--text-muted);
				font-style: italic;
				max-width: 600px;
				margin: 0 auto;
			}
			.scroll-hint {
				position: absolute;
				bottom: 2.5rem;
				left: 50%;
				transform: translateX(-50%);
				z-index: 1;
				display: flex;
				flex-direction: column;
				align-items: center;
				gap: 0.5rem;
				opacity: 0.5;
			}
			.scroll-hint span {
				font-size: 0.75rem;
				letter-spacing: 0.15em;
				text-transform: uppercase;
				color: var(--text-muted);
			}
			.scroll-line {
				width: 1px;
				height: 40px;
				background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--text-muted), transparent);
				animation: scrollPulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
			}
			@keyframes scrollPulse {
				0%,
				100% {
					opacity: 0.3;
					height: 30px;
				}
				50% {
					opacity: 0.8;
					height: 50px;
				}
			}

			/* ── Sections ── */
			.section {
				padding: 5rem 2rem;
				position: relative;
			}
			.section-inner {
				max-width: 720px;
				margin: 0 auto;
			}
			.section-wide {
				max-width: 1000px;
				margin: 0 auto;
			}

		/* Section backgrounds */
		.bg-dark {
			background-color: var(--bg-deep);
		}
			.bg-solar {
				background: linear-gradient(
					180deg,
					var(--bg-deep) 0%,
					#1a1208 30%,
					#1a1208 70%,
					var(--bg-deep) 100%
				);
			}
			.bg-lunar {
				background: linear-gradient(
					180deg,
					var(--bg-deep) 0%,
					#0a0f1a 30%,
					#0a0f1a 70%,
					var(--bg-deep) 100%
				);
		}

		/* Background images */
		.bg-1 {
			background-image: url('/images/other/SunVsMoon-1.webp');
			background-size: cover;
			background-position: center;
		}

		/* ── Dramatic statement ── */
			.statement {
				min-height: 50vh;
				display: flex;
				align-items: center;
				justify-content: center;
				text-align: center;
				padding: 4rem 2rem;
			}
			.statement p {
				font-family: var(--font-display);
				font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3rem);
				font-weight: 600;
				line-height: 1.3;
				max-width: 800px;
				background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fbbf24, #e5e7eb, #93c5fd);
				-webkit-background-clip: text;
				-webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
				background-clip: text;
			}

			/* ── Split panel ── */
			.split {
				display: grid;
				grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
				gap: 1px;
				min-height: 40vh;
				background: #1a1a2e;
			}
			.split-panel {
				display: flex;
				align-items: center;
				justify-content: center;
				padding: 3rem 2rem;
				text-align: center;
			}
			.split-panel.solar {
				background: linear-gradient(
					135deg,
					#1a1208 0%,
					#2d1a06 50%,
					#1a1208 100%
				);
				border-right: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2);
			}
			.split-panel.lunar {
				background: linear-gradient(
					225deg,
					#0a0f1a 0%,
					#0c1a2d 50%,
					#0a0f1a 100%
				);
				border-left: 1px solid rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.2);
			}
			.split-panel p {
				font-family: var(--font-display);
				font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2.5vw, 1.5rem);
				font-style: italic;
				max-width: 400px;
				line-height: 1.5;
			}
			.split-panel.solar p {
				color: #fcd34d;
			}
			.split-panel.lunar p {
				color: #93c5fd;
			}

			/* ── Section titles ── */
			.section-title {
				font-family: var(--font-display);
				font-size: 2rem;
				font-weight: 600;
				letter-spacing: 0.03em;
				text-align: center;
				margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
				color: #d1d5db;
			}
			.section-title::after {
				content: '';
				display: block;
				width: 60px;
				height: 2px;
				margin: 1rem auto 0;
				background: linear-gradient(
					90deg,
					var(--solar-glow),
					var(--lunar-glow)
				);
			}

			/* ── Table ── */
			.table-wrap {
				overflow-x: auto;
				margin: 0 -2rem;
				padding: 0 2rem;
			}
			.comparison-table {
				width: 100%;
				border-collapse: collapse;
				font-size: 0.95rem;
			}
			.comparison-table thead th {
				padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
				text-align: left;
				font-family: var(--font-display);
				font-size: 0.85rem;
				letter-spacing: 0.08em;
				text-transform: uppercase;
				border-bottom: 2px solid #374151;
			}
			.comparison-table thead th:first-child {
				color: var(--text-muted);
				width: 22%;
			}
			.comparison-table thead th:nth-child(2) {
				color: #fbbf24;
			}
			.comparison-table thead th:nth-child(3) {
				color: #93c5fd;
			}
			.comparison-table tbody td {
				padding: 0.75rem 1.2rem;
				border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
				vertical-align: top;
			}
			.comparison-table tbody td:first-child {
				color: var(--text-muted);
				font-style: italic;
				font-size: 0.85rem;
				letter-spacing: 0.03em;
			}
			.comparison-table tbody td:nth-child(2) {
				background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.03);
			}
			.comparison-table tbody td:nth-child(3) {
				background: rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.03);
			}
			.comparison-table tbody tr:hover td {
				background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
			}

			/* ── History cards ── */
			.history-grid {
				display: grid;
				gap: 1.5rem;
			}
			.history-card {
				padding: 2rem;
				border-radius: 4px;
			}
			.history-card.solar-card {
				background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.05);
				border-left: 3px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.4);
			}
			.history-card.lunar-card {
				background: rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.05);
				border-left: 3px solid rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.4);
			}
			.history-card.neutral-card {
				background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
				border-left: 3px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
			}
			.history-card .card-label {
				font-family: var(--font-display);
				font-size: 0.7rem;
				letter-spacing: 0.12em;
				text-transform: uppercase;
				margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
			}
			.solar-card .card-label {
				color: #f59e0b;
			}
			.lunar-card .card-label {
				color: #60a5fa;
			}
			.neutral-card .card-label {
				color: var(--text-muted);
			}

			/* ── Zohra section ── */
			.zohra-section {
				background: linear-gradient(
					180deg,
					var(--bg-deep) 0%,
					#0f0a14 40%,
					#0f0a14 60%,
					var(--bg-deep) 100%
				);
			}
			.zohra-section .highlight {
				color: #c084fc;
				font-style: italic;
			}

			/* ── Closing ── */
			.closing {
				min-height: 80vh;
				display: flex;
				flex-direction: column;
				align-items: center;
				justify-content: center;
				text-align: center;
				padding: 4rem 2rem;
			}
			.closing-line {
				font-family: var(--font-display);
				font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2rem);
				line-height: 1.5;
				margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
				max-width: 700px;
				opacity: 0.85;
			}
			.closing-final {
				font-family: var(--font-display);
				font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
				font-weight: 700;
				line-height: 1.2;
				margin-top: 2rem;
				letter-spacing: 0.02em;
			}
			.closing-final .moon-text {
				background: linear-gradient(
					180deg,
					#e5e7eb 0%,
					#93c5fd 50%,
					#60a5fa 100%
				);
				-webkit-background-clip: text;
				-webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
				background-clip: text;
			}

			/* ── Back link ── */
			.back-section {
				padding: 3rem 2rem 5rem;
				text-align: center;
			}
			.back-link {
				display: inline-block;
				font-family: var(--font-display);
				font-size: 1rem;
				color: var(--text-muted);
				text-decoration: none;
				padding: 0.6rem 1.5rem;
				border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
				border-radius: 2px;
				transition: all 0.3s;
			}
			.back-link:hover {
				color: var(--text-primary);
				border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
				background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
			}

			/* ── Responsive ── */
			@media (max-width: 768px) {
				.split {
					grid-template-columns: 1fr;
				}
				.split-panel.solar {
					border-right: none;
					border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2);
				}
				.split-panel.lunar {
					border-left: none;
					border-top: 1px solid rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.2);
				}
				.section {
					padding: 3rem 1.2rem;
				}
				.comparison-table {
					font-size: 0.8rem;
				}
				.comparison-table thead th,
				.comparison-table tbody td {
					padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem;
				}
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<!-- ═══════════ HERO ═══════════ -->
		<section class="hero">
			<div class="hero-content">
				<h1>{pageTitle}</h1>
				<p class="date">{dateStr}</p>
				<p class="summary">{pageSummary}</p>
			</div>
			<div class="scroll-hint">
				<span>{isEs ? 'Desliza' : 'Scroll'}</span>
				<div class="scroll-line"></div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- ═══════════ INTRO ═══════════ -->
		<section class="section bg-dark bg-1">
			<div class="section-inner">
				<p style="font-size:1.25rem;line-height:1.8;">{t.intro1}</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- ═══════════ STATEMENT: SOL VS LUNA ═══════════ -->
		<section class="statement bg-dark">
			<p>{t.callIt}</p>
		</section>

		<section class="section bg-dark">
			<div class="section-inner">
				<p style="color:var(--text-muted);">{t.intro2}</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- ═══════════ SPLIT: DOS LÓGICAS ═══════════ -->
		<section
			class="section bg-dark"
			style="padding-bottom:0;">
			<div class="section-inner">
				<h2 class="section-title">{t.logicasTitle}</h2>
			</div>
		</section>

		<div class="split">
			<div class="split-panel solar">
				<p>{t.solarLogic}</p>
			</div>
			<div class="split-panel lunar">
				<p>{t.lunarLogic}</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<!-- ═══════════ TABLE ═══════════ -->
		<section class="section bg-dark">
			<div class="section-wide">
				<div class="table-wrap">
					<table class="comparison-table">
						<thead>
							<tr>
								<th>{t.tableAspect}</th>
								<th>{t.tableSolar}</th>
								<th>{t.tableLunar}</th>
							</tr>
						</thead>
						<tbody>
							{
								t.tableRows.map(([aspect, solar, lunar]) => (
									<tr>
										<td>{aspect}</td>
										<td>{solar}</td>
										<td>{lunar}</td>
									</tr>
								))
							}
						</tbody>
					</table>
				</div>
				<p
					style="margin-top:2rem;color:var(--text-muted);text-align:center;font-style:italic;">
					{t.tableNote}
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- ═══════════ HISTORIA ═══════════ -->
		<section class="section bg-dark">
			<div class="section-inner">
				<h2 class="section-title">{t.historiaTitle}</h2>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section
			class="section bg-dark"
			style="padding-top:0;">
			<div class="section-inner">
				<div class="history-grid">
					<div class="history-card solar-card">
						<div class="card-label">
							{isEs ? 'Solar · Babilonia' : 'Solar · Babylon'}
						</div>
						<p>{t.histBabylon}</p>
					</div>
					<div class="history-card lunar-card">
						<div class="card-label">
							{isEs ? 'Lunar · Islam Sunita' : 'Lunar · Sunni Islam'}
						</div>
						<p>{t.histSunni}</p>
					</div>
					<div class="history-card solar-card">
						<div class="card-label">
							{isEs ? 'Solar · Chiismo' : 'Solar · Shiism'}
						</div>
						<p>{t.histShia}</p>
					</div>
					<div class="history-card solar-card">
						<div class="card-label">
							{isEs ? 'Solar · Catolicismo' : 'Solar · Catholicism'}
						</div>
						<p>{t.histCatholic}</p>
					</div>
					<div class="history-card neutral-card">
						<div class="card-label">&nbsp;</div>
						<p>{t.histNone}</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- ═══════════ ZOHRA ═══════════ -->
		<section class="section zohra-section">
			<div class="section-inner">
				<h2
					class="section-title"
					style="color:#c084fc;">
					{t.zohraTitle}
				</h2>
				<p style="margin-bottom:1.3rem;">{t.zohra1}</p>
				<p style="margin-bottom:1.3rem;">{t.zohra2}</p>
				<p class="highlight">{t.zohra3}</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- ═══════════ CLOSING ═══════════ -->
		<section class="closing">
			<h2 class="section-title">{t.cierreTitle}</h2>
			<p class="closing-line">{t.cierre1}</p>
			<p class="closing-line">{t.cierre2}</p>
			<p class="closing-line">{t.cierre3}</p>
			<p class="closing-line">{t.cierre4}</p>
			<p class="closing-line">{t.cierre5}</p>
			<p
				class="closing-line"
				style="font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:1rem;">
				{t.cierre6}
			</p>
			<p class="closing-final">
				<span class="moon-text">{t.cierreMoon}</span><br />
				<span
					class="moon-text"
					style="font-size:0.7em;opacity:0.8;"
					>{t.cierreForget}</span
				>
			</p>
		</section>

		<!-- ═══════════ BACK ═══════════ -->
		<section class="back-section">
			<a
				href={`/${locale}/cuaderno/`}
				class="back-link"
				>{t.backLabel}</a
			>
		</section>

	</body>
</html>
